b177-4b24-84d9-418f80b607b8","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あれ実は直前までは違ったんですよね。。。公明党がゴネた。というか創価学会が動いた","ts":"1619892521.454700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n0H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b76b44c-8bab-405f-8dfe-f61f96ba934e","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"給付金でiPad Air買ったのでとりあえずは経済回した\n現金配るのが最善とはとても思わなかったけど、対応のスピードも求められてた状況だったので\nあんまり凝った政策は検討する時間取れなかったんじゃないかなと思ったりもしてた","ts":"1619892464.454000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RtN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1222ae21-efd1-480d-973a-2be82c51d255","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"別に収入が増えようが支出は変わらない","ts":"1619890725.452400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Ou"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e95a7b7-3b28-4bad-8c6b-0d52e00d3bcd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分も回しました","ts":"1619890716.452100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HUf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3f06fb5-6600-4d40-8383-742caa0e5a86","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"現金ですか？まあ言っちゃなんだけど結構貯金にも回した","ts":"1619890693.451800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T5un"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e59314c-59d2-4508-8de8-8b735ba0c757","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"しんどい","ts":"1619890691.451600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y7b5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37941da6-de76-4478-889f-ae3ccad21384","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"パソコン買おうとしたんですが、 80000 円に対して 8000 円かかるのつらいですね","ts":"1619890686.4513